@startuml request_lifecycle
' Callosum request lifecycle — what happens between a client POST and
' the streamed response, including the parts the operator surfaces in
' callosum-ctl / snorkel / /events/routing care about.
'
' This is a sequence at the process-internal level — not API contracts.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #444444
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFE4B5
  ParticipantFontColor #000000
}

participant "Client" as C
participant "FastAPI\napp.py" as App
participant "Router\nrouting/*" as R
participant "Capability\nFilter" as CF
participant "Selector" as S
participant "Backend\n(picked cell)" as B
participant "Upstream\n(cloud or local)" as U
participant "Usage\nLog" as UL
database "operator_state\n.sqlite" as OS

C -> App : POST /v1/responses (stream)
App -> OS : get_mode() + denylist
App -> R : route(body, cells_after_mode_filter)
R -> R : extract_features(body)\n(tokens, modalities, needs_tools)
R -> CF : filter(cells, features)
CF --> R : compatible cells
R -> R : predict(features, compatible)\n(uniform | knn)
R -> S : select(scaled_predictions, capabilities)\n(cost_rank = MEASURED weekly-quota\nburn; CostRankProvider overlay)
S --> R : chosen cell + ranked candidates
R --> App : RoutingDecision

note right of App
  Synthetic explorer:
  if requested_model ==
  "auto-learning-synthetic",
  override chosen with the
  LEAST-sampled candidate
  (coverage_from_db) so the
  whole cell grid is sampled.
  Organic traffic keeps the
  cost-optimal pick.
end note

note right of App
  Cell-retry walks
  candidates on 5xx
  (not on 4xx).
end note

App -> B : responses_stream(body)
B -> U : POST /responses or /v1/chat/completions
U --> B : SSE event stream
B -> B : ResponsesStreamCollector\ntees bytes for usage parse
B --> App : SSE bytes (forwarded)
App --> C : SSE bytes (yielded as they arrive)

note over B
  Backend sets
  handle.stream_summary
  after stream end.
end note

B --> App : stream complete
App -> UL : record(UsageLogEntry)\n(tokens parsed from response.completed)

note right of UL
  usage_log.record() triggers
  /events/routing broadcaster
  notify() → snorkel sidecar
  HUD updates in real time.
end note

App -> App : CostUsageEstimator.finalize()\n(realized weekly-quota delta;\n0 delta = verifiable=false →\naggregate calibration only)

@enduml
